+**2026-08-21 — Independent post-deploy verification. 26/28 green; two failures, both found by measuring.**
+
+Full report: `docs/review/2026-08-21-post-deploy-verification.md`. The checklist was fixed before any evidence was gathered, and every claim in it is labelled Verified / Inferred / Unverified.
